 " \[LineSeparator]",
 "gives the property ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["prop", "TI"]], "InlineFormula", ExpressionUUID->
  "445a1261-7624-b741-ad98-048aea395595"],
 " of the evolution.",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo", ExpressionUUID->
  "9ae96d83-a77c-3544-9599-ab7fd3c900cf"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["ObliviousRingMachine",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
