DecodeCyclicTagToObliviousRingMachine"]], "InlineFormula", ExpressionUUID->
  "5289cc8f-561d-2b42-81c7-35ca20855857"],
 " decodes the evolution of the compiled system:"
}], "ExampleText",
 CellID->920189498, ExpressionUUID->"d51f1a81-8fc2-874f-84e7-65400c33ba04"],

